  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Decomposition of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math> exhibits a rate constant of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.05</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#956;g</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>year</mi></math>. How many years are required for the decomposition of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#956;g</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math> into <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.5</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#956;g</mi></math>?",
