  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>According to unit of rate constant, it is a zero order reaction.&nbsp;Then, half life of reaction will be:<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mrow><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>50&#160;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
